      "writtenOn": "2019-07-09T22:23:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What happens if there is no IO expander (for example, all existing boards)?\n\nDoes link-time optimization get rid of this lookup step?  Or does this bloat code and slow runtime?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 251,
        "startChar": 0,
